 "cover_area_title": null,
 "raw_text": "9/29/26, 9:48 AM\n\nCredit Rating Out\n\nDefinition\n\nThe Credit Rating Out outbound service interface contains an operation that sends and queries credit ratings.\n\nTechnical Data\n\nEntity Type               Service Interface\nCategory                  SAP A2A\nDirection                  outbound\n\nQuery Credit Rating\n\nDefinition\n\nTo send debtors\u2019 credit ratings that are calculated in contract accounting.\n\nTechnical Data\n\nEntity Type                              Service Operation\n\nRelease State                           released\n\nTechnical Name                       FICARatingReplicateQuery_Out\nNamespace                             http://sap.com/xi/FICA Pie\nApplication Component              FI-CA\n\nCategory                                 SAP A2A\n\nDirection                                    outbound\n\nMode                                         asynchronous\n\nIdempotency                            not applicable\n\nP2P Communication Enabled       yes\n\nBusiness Context and Use\n\nThis outbound service operation sends debitor\u2019s credit rating information from your contract accounting system to the requesting\ncomponent.\n\nRelated Operations\n",
